#: scenario:scenario_2AFF8341_4A3E_430F_A1D6_31F2D481EF83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32622997b43b4126db60f1d6bfb6fd246689fe72be747afe9f4cf2709d08ecaf
#. default-sha256: b8504ef4319f71be5eec126562b7c48cf04e2146518f8bba6d3a03f3fc8ea715
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2AFF8341_4A3E_430F_A1D6_31F2D481EF83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The crestfallen young man faded into the distance, and the decrepit double doors "
"clacked shut."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Le jeune homme abattu s’efface peu à peu, et la double porte décrépite se referme."

#: scenario:scenario_43A49B46_7AAD_44A2_B999_45334FEA1E47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a36a7c78dc8d4673de003fc208b4229626038e68ebc21c45f04f6d0c1ea2ce8
#. default-sha256: 1f61940c43f41c444eb6e5912fda51f9983c65345f383aabd7dd0d7385375c2d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_43A49B46_7AAD_44A2_B999_45334FEA1E47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Through the shattered glass, ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ could see only the ruins of a "
"garden, not a single rose growing within. ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You⟪k:6⟫He⟪k:7⟫ had evidently returned from "
"the past."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫À⟪k:2⟫ travers le verre brisé, ⟪k:3⟫vous pouvez⟪k:4⟫le Défunt pouvait⟪k:5⟫ distinguer "
"un jardin en ruines ; pas une seule rose n’y pousse. ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Vous êtes⟪k:8⟫Il était⟪k:9⟫ de "
"toute évidence revenu du passé."

#: scenario:scenario_0FB3F01D_B617_4D13_8095_F4F8541039DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14e9979e67fb1b0782b5c8561b58f5bc5e483ff644bdeb52187484166cd0a209
#. default-sha256: 9a32c8410ddbccb78900239c046d50d4e94bbccdf8ff0add36e76109e97814ff
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0FB3F01D_B617_4D13_8095_F4F8541039DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In the garden, weeds grew taller than people. ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ found it difficult to "
"look at. ⟪k:4⟫A wolf howled in the distance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le jardin regorge de mauvaises herbes plus grandes que des humains. ⟪k:1⟫Vous n’arrivez⟪k:2⟫"
"Il n’arrivait⟪k:3⟫ plus à le regarder. ⟪k:4⟫Un loup hurle au loin."

#: scenario:scenario_93B40010_CB1F_4857_8A6C_0EE53963A89B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6aae881a73d0fd45bf80fb027f86180ceb1f93ca1fba8a6a5c7f4add1d388db1
#. default-sha256: ea9bbd3832db80aa015d310ff32b6fa1f6a87d2f0309b797d2376eb92328612f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_93B40010_CB1F_4857_8A6C_0EE53963A89B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The children, the sea of roses, and the White-Haired Girl were nowhere to be found."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Les enfants, la mer de roses et la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs ont disparu."

