#: scenario:scenario_23DC6B01_83EC_42FB_8E1C_A0D23A5383B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29b035cb90e88e330b68bca0aa5621fa0944d82d8ba7eda48c38dc5cad012728
